#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:361
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DJMOD_OPERATIVE_DIES\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"So.\" Your new but already dying crew's face is dead serious. \"Since you "
"paid for me... you must be looking for... our special kind of goods, "
"right?\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:365
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DJMOD_OPERATIVE_DIES\"]/choice[@req=\"DJMOD_NO_COORDS_NO_VISIT_RADIKAL_SECTOR\"]/text"
msgstr "...Sure, why not?"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:367
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DJMOD_OPERATIVE_DIES\"]/choice[@req=\"DJMOD_NO_COORDS_NO_VISIT_RADIKAL_SECTOR\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"He's clearly struggling to speak. \"Then... make your way there, loaded with all the scr-... Ugh. All the scrap you can find... to fund progress. You'll find your way. M-... my mission is over.\" He hands you some hidden sector's coordinates, then dies.\n"
"\t\t\tYou notice he was already gravely injured and only held on until he could deliver this to somebody, fooling both the store owner and yourself. Some valuable tech in his pocket helps you recoup your losses. \n"
"\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\tMaybe you'll find out what that was all about the next time you reroute in hyperspeed..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:377
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DJMOD_OPERATIVE_DIES\"]/choice[@req=\"DJMOD_NO_COORDS_NO_VISIT_RADIKAL_SECTOR\"]/event/choice/text"
msgstr ""
"Curious dedication, for what looks like nothing more than a black market "
"advert."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:384
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DJMOD_OPERATIVE_DIES\"]/choice[@req=\"visited_radikal_sector\"]/text"
msgstr "We've already visited the RadiKal Sector. Rest in peace, soldier."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:386
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DJMOD_OPERATIVE_DIES\"]/choice[@req=\"visited_radikal_sector\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Progress sha- shall continue... it does bring me comfort... to die among friends... Thank you.\" He dies with a faint smile on his face.\n"
"\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\tAs usual this agent had an incurable disease and volunteered to spread awareness for RK funding and recruit reckless captains, so you're not surprised. You proceed to loot his valuable tech and dispose of the body."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:394
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DJMOD_OPERATIVE_DIES\"]/choice[@req=\"visited_radikal_sector\"]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:401
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DJMOD_OPERATIVE_DIES\"]/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "What? Of course not. Hold tight!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:403
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DJMOD_OPERATIVE_DIES\"]/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Don't b- *cough* ... bother, it's too late ... for me... I... ha-... have failed.\" Looking mortified, he crushes a small chip inscribed with a couple capital letters, which briefly but intensely burns. Then he dies.\n"
"\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\tYou proceed to strip the body, notice the swelling and necrosis, and wonder why selling you illegal gear mattered more to that guy more than his impending death. You wonder if the store owner knew and just scammed you.\n"
"\t\t\tAt least there's some valuable tech in the dead soldier's pocket to recoup your losses."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:412
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DJMOD_OPERATIVE_DIES\"]/choice[3]/event/choice/text"
msgstr ""
"There are surely other ways to revisit this mystery and get to wherever it "
"was going. Moving on."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:478
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"A ship with very special offensive, defensive and intelligence equipment in Elite colors is here.\n"
"\t\tThey must be on high alert judging by how fast they hail you."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:485
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr ""
"You do not have any RadiKal (RK) gear at all. That might have just saved "
"you."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:490
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Take the hail"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:492
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Hello citizens. Do you know anything about the RadiKals? Also known as "
"'RK'.\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:495
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do we know any radicals? I wouldn't say so."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:497
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"That's not quite what I mean. Then allow me to educate you on this matter of public safety.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tRK is a semi-secret group of bad people who do bad things, and incite others do the same by selling them the bad things they made.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tYou look like an upstanding citizen since you don't have anything RadiKal. Yes, we have deep-scanned your ship, twice for good measure."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:503
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Whoa OK, respecting privacy much?"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:505
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Don't be a hipster, everybody knows 'privacy' died sometime around the early 21st century. Back to the topic.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWe are proudly part of the Anti-RadiKal Secret Service (ARKSS). We wouldn't normally tell you this, but we ne- ... could use more hands, and you look capable.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tIf you wish to ensure your own safety, or even join the good fight against them, we sell the right tools that you won't find anywhere else.\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:511
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Hmmm fine, let's see."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:513
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Good. Don't let it fall into the wrong hands.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAnd if you encounter any of that scum afterwards: do not take their hails, aim for the head, and 'May Order Prevail'.\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:525
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "They went that way."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:527
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Thank you for your cooperation.\" They immediately throw a reward package "
"through an airlock and depart. Hopefully, by some odds there actually are "
"RadiKals that way, or you better hope you never see this ship again."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:538
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Maybe, maybe not, but we're attacking you!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:540
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Hmpf! You don't have the gear, but you must be sympathisers. Same scum, different tools. Albrecht?\"\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\"Ready, sir.\"\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\"Deploy!\"\n"
"\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tThey power up their weapons and simultaneously eject an auxiliary ship with big engines and cannons, which quickly goes some distance away to provide artillery support.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tWhoever they are, these guys don't mess around!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:550
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[3]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:559
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/text"
msgstr ""
"You have RadiKal (RK) gear, which by definition is illegal almost everywhere.\n"
"\t\t\tRight now, that could cost you dearly, as that ship seems to be scanning it specifically!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:565
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[4]/text"
msgstr "...I don't like this one bit. Attack!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:567
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_RK_DETECTED_ATTACK\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You don't even have time to give the order. That ship must have been scanning you since the moment you jumped in. And they have already decided to eliminate you!\n"
"\t\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\t\"Judgement be passed on you, despicable Chaos sympathising terrorists. I never could find the ones directly responsible, but at least you will pay for Zeta-708T56-C Secundus's Northern Moonbase!\"\n"
"\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\tThey power up their weapons (which seem tailored to destroy RK ships) and simultaneously eject an auxiliary ship with big engines and cannons, which quickly goes some distance away to provide artillery support.\n"
"\t\t\tWhoever they are, these guys don't mess around!"

