msgstr "They went that way."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:780
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_QUEST_START\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Thank you for your cooperation.\" They immediately throw a reward package "
"through an airlock and depart. Hopefully, by some odds there actually are "
"RadiKals that way, or you better hope you never see this ship again."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:791
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_QUEST_START\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Never mind them, we're attacking you!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:793
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_QUEST_START\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Hmpf! You don't have the gear, but you must be sympathisers. Same scum, different tools. Mordred?\"\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\"Ready, sir.\"\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\"Deploy!\"\n"
"\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tThey power up their weapons and simultaneously eject an auxiliary ship with big engines and cannons, which quickly goes some distance away to provide artillery support.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tWhoever they are, these guys don't mess around!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:803
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_QUEST_START\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[3]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:812
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/text"
msgstr ""
"You have RadiKal (RK) gear, which by definition is illegal almost everywhere.\n"
"\t\t\tRight now, that could cost you dearly, as that ship seems to be scanning it specifically!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:817
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_QUEST_START\"]/choice[4]/text"
msgstr "...I don't like this one bit. Attack!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:819
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_RK_DETECTED_ATTACK\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You don't even have time to give the order. That ship must have been scanning you since the moment you jumped in. And they have already decided to eliminate you!\n"
"\t\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\t\"Judgement be passed on you, despicable Chaos sympathising terrorists. I never could find the ones directly responsible, but at least you will pay for MY FAMILY YOU SICK FU-\"\n"
"\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\tYou cut comms as they power up their weapons and simultaneously eject an auxiliary ship with big engines and cannons, which quickly goes some distance away to provide artillery support.\n"
"\t\t\tWhoever they are, these guys don't mess around!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:829
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_RK_DETECTED_ATTACK\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:831
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_RK_DETECTED_ATTACK\"]/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"A sudden explosion also makes your ears ring. They must have used some sort "
"of combat augment on your Engines!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:836
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_RK_DETECTED_ATTACK\"]/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:844
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_QUEST_START\"]/choice[5]/text"
msgstr "...I don't like this one bit. Try to run!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:860
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DEFEAT_RK_A_POLICE_INTRO\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"As soon as the ship is defeated, your scanners detect multiple micro-charges detonating inside it, ruining most of the salvage. Whatever control freak supervises these guys doesn't leave much to chance.\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\tWith the auxiliary ship way out of your range and still firing, you grab some meager scrap."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:866
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DEFEAT_RK_A_POLICE_INTRO\"]/choice/text"
msgstr ""
"What a punishing fight. Is that the real cost of using RadiKal gear? No "
"matter, take a quick look around, then let's move!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:875
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DEFEAT_RK_A_POLICE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"As soon as the ship is defeated, your scanners detect multiple micro-charges detonating inside it, ruining most of the salvage. Whatever control freak supervises these guys doesn't leave much to chance.\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\tWith the auxiliary ship way out of your range and still firing, you grab some meager scrap."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:882
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DEFEAT_RK_A_POLICE\"]/choice/text"
msgstr ""
"Just the cost of being outlaws. Take a quick look around, then let's move!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:893
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//eventList[@name=\"DEFEAT_RK_A_POLICE_LOOT_CHANCE\"]/event[1]/text"
msgstr ""
"There is nothing worth taking left.\n"
"\t\t\tIt's time to jump away from the artillery fire."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:901
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//eventList[@name=\"DEFEAT_RK_A_POLICE_LOOT_CHANCE\"]/event[2]/text"
msgstr ""
"You notice a weapon that's somehow still intact and bring it onboard.\n"
"\t\t\tIt's time to jump away from the artillery fire."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:910
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//eventList[@name=\"DEFEAT_RK_A_POLICE_LOOT_CHANCE\"]/event[3]/text"
msgstr ""
"You notice a weapon that's somehow still intact and bring it onboard.\n"
"\t\t\tIt's time to jump away from the artillery fire."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:934
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_EVENT_STORE_RADIKAL\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"Your sensors stop functioning and your view is suddenly obscured, but apparently that's just the doing of a very cautious and well-equipped band of traders. No wonder, with all the shady business going on around here.\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t[Warning: Limited purchases]"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:937
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_EVENT_STORE_RADIKAL\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"You can't see any shop in the vicinity, but soon a drone from a very well camouflaged ship takes your order.\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t[Warning: Limited purchases]"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:940
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_EVENT_STORE_RADIKAL\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"You are quickly scanned and told to stay right here while the owner of a shop that's too far to see arranges remote delivery of your purchases.\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t[Warning: Limited purchases]"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:943
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_EVENT_STORE_RADIKAL\"]/text[4]"
msgstr ""
"While you wait at the trading spot, a tiny drone entertains you with an endless feed of funny videos.\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t[Warning: Limited purchases]"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:946
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_EVENT_STORE_RADIKAL\"]/text[5]"
msgstr ""
"You are forced to leave your ship parked outside while you do your shopping closely escorted inside what looked like a random asteroid.\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t[Warning: Limited purchases]"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:949
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_EVENT_STORE_RADIKAL\"]/text[6]"
msgstr ""
"The clerk here is very quiet. Once you install the goods in your ship, as per the deal you wipe recent records so that the merchant's ship appears to have never been here at all.\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t[Warning: Limited purchases]"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:952
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_EVENT_STORE_RADIKAL\"]/text[7]"
msgstr ""
"You reluctantly agree to leave your ship in an empty space matrix before they grant you access to the store, and when you exit it, there is no other ship but yours here.\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t[Warning: Limited purchases]"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:963
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RADIKAL_ENSLAVED\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Slavers are quite comfortably installed in this sector, in great part due to"
" the lack of regulation. You stumble upon one."

